WEBVTT

00:00:01.311 --> 00:00:03.144
GOOD AFTERNOON, HARRY.

00:00:03.188 --> 00:00:04.580
AH.

00:00:04.624 --> 00:00:07.192
TOKENS FROM
YOUR ADMIRERS?

00:00:07.235 --> 00:00:09.498
ADMIRERS?

00:00:09.542 --> 00:00:11.239
WHAT HAPPENED
DOWN IN THE DUNGEONS

00:00:11.283 --> 00:00:13.502
BETWEEN YOU
AND PROFESSOR QUIRRELL

00:00:13.546 --> 00:00:15.635
IS A COMPLETE SECRET.

00:00:15.678 --> 00:00:19.421
SO, NATURALLY,
THE WHOLE SCHOOL KNOWS.

00:00:22.903 --> 00:00:24.034
AH,

00:00:24.078 --> 00:00:25.384
I SEE THAT
YOUR FRIEND RONALD

00:00:25.427 --> 00:00:26.907
HAS SAVED YOU THE TROUBLE

00:00:26.950 --> 00:00:29.779
OF OPENING
YOUR CHOCOLATE FROGS.

00:00:29.823 --> 00:00:30.954
RON WAS HERE?

00:00:30.998 --> 00:00:32.826
IS HE ALL RIGHT?
WHAT ABOUT HERMIONE?

00:00:32.869 --> 00:00:34.915
FINE.

00:00:34.958 --> 00:00:38.397
THEY'RE BOTH JUST FINE.

00:00:38.440 --> 00:00:39.833
BUT WHAT HAPPENED
TO THE STONE?

00:00:39.876 --> 00:00:41.530
RELAX, DEAR BOY.

00:00:41.574 --> 00:00:44.925
THE STONE
HAS BEEN DESTROYED.

00:00:44.968 --> 00:00:47.928
MY FRIEND NICHOLAS AND I
HAVE HAD A LITTLE CHAT

00:00:47.971 --> 00:00:50.757
AND AGREED IT WAS BEST

00:00:50.800 --> 00:00:53.150
ALL AROUND.

00:00:53.194 --> 00:00:54.587
BUT THEN, FLAMEL...

00:00:54.630 --> 00:00:56.415
HE'LL DIE, WON'T HE?

00:00:58.982 --> 00:01:00.767
HE HAS ENOUGH ELIXIR

00:01:00.810 --> 00:01:03.770
TO SET HIS AFFAIRS
IN ORDER,

00:01:03.813 --> 00:01:08.340
BUT, YES, HE WILL DIE.

00:01:08.383 --> 00:01:10.603
HOW IS IT
I GOT THE STONE, SIR?

00:01:10.646 --> 00:01:12.300
ONE MINUTE, I WAS
STARING IN THE MIRROR,

00:01:12.344 --> 00:01:13.388
AND THE NEXT--

00:01:13.432 --> 00:01:17.697
AH. YOU SEE,
ONLY A PERSON

00:01:17.740 --> 00:01:20.047
WHO WANTED TO FIND
THE STONE--

00:01:20.090 --> 00:01:24.530
FIND IT,
BUT NOT USE IT--

00:01:24.573 --> 00:01:27.533
WOULD BE ABLE TO GET IT.

00:01:27.576 --> 00:01:31.188
THAT IS ONE OF MY
MORE BRILLIANT IDEAS,

00:01:31.232 --> 00:01:35.280
AND BETWEEN YOU AND ME,
THAT IS SAYING SOMETHING.

00:01:37.717 --> 00:01:39.240
DOES THAT MEAN,

00:01:39.284 --> 00:01:41.111
WITH THE STONE GONE,
THAT IS,

00:01:41.155 --> 00:01:43.288
THAT VOLDEMORT
CAN NEVER COME BACK?

00:01:43.331 --> 00:01:46.987
AH, I'M AFRAID...

00:01:47.030 --> 00:01:51.339
THERE ARE WAYS
IN WHICH HE CAN RETURN.

00:01:51.383 --> 00:01:55.822
HARRY, DO YOU KNOW
WHY PROFESSOR QUIRRELL

00:01:55.865 --> 00:01:58.738
COULDN'T BEAR TO HAVE
YOU TOUCH HIM?

00:01:58.781 --> 00:02:01.131
IT WAS BECAUSE
OF YOUR MOTHER.

00:02:01.175 --> 00:02:03.786
SHE SACRIFICED
HERSELF FOR YOU,

00:02:03.830 --> 00:02:06.746
AND THAT KIND OF ACT
LEAVES A MARK.

00:02:06.789 --> 00:02:08.661
NO, NO.

00:02:08.704 --> 00:02:11.403
THIS KIND OF MARK
CAN NOT BE SEEN.

00:02:11.446 --> 00:02:14.406
IT LIVES
IN YOUR VERY SKIN.

00:02:14.449 --> 00:02:16.625
WHAT IS IT?

00:02:16.669 --> 00:02:19.541
LOVE, HARRY.

00:02:19.585 --> 00:02:21.151
LOVE.

00:02:27.854 --> 00:02:28.942
AH.

00:02:28.985 --> 00:02:33.250
BERTIE BOTT'S
EVERY FLAVOR BEANS.

00:02:33.294 --> 00:02:35.383
I WAS MOST UNFORTUNATE
IN MY YOUTH

00:02:35.427 --> 00:02:38.255
TO COME ACROSS
A VOMIT-FLAVORED ONE,

00:02:38.299 --> 00:02:41.563
AND SINCE THEN, I'M AFRAID,
I'VE LOST MY LIKING FOR THEM.

00:02:41.607 --> 00:02:44.740
BUT I THINK
I COULD BE SAFE

00:02:44.784 --> 00:02:46.829
WITH A NICE TOFFEE.

00:02:50.442 --> 00:02:51.704
MMM.

00:02:51.747 --> 00:02:53.793
ALAS.

00:02:53.836 --> 00:02:55.142
EAR WAX.

00:03:11.027 --> 00:03:12.855
ALL RIGHT THERE, RON?

00:03:12.899 --> 00:03:14.944
ALL RIGHT. YOU?

00:03:14.988 --> 00:03:17.338
ALL RIGHT.

00:03:17.382 --> 00:03:18.731
HERMIONE?

00:03:18.774 --> 00:03:21.298
NEVER BETTER.

00:03:28.871 --> 00:03:30.830
[DINGING]

00:03:36.662 --> 00:03:37.903
ANOTHER YEAR GONE.

